---

EmuSteam bundles no third-party code. Two optional commands download assets:

  npm run fetch-cores   EmulatorJS and libretro cores. EmulatorJS is GPL-3.0;
                        the cores carry their own upstream licences.
  npm run fetch-art     Box art from the libretro thumbnail archive (community
                        scans, used as-is), and console icons from
                        libretro/retroarch-assets, which are licensed
                        CC BY 4.0 — attribution: "RetroArch assets by the
                        libretro team, CC BY 4.0".

Neither runs unless you ask it to. ROMs and emulator builds are not included and
are not ours to distribute.
